OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and settled to start the
OL,6,Fnew week with light winds. Sunny
OL,7,Fspells for many, though these may turn
OL,8,Fhazy at times as areas of cloud drift
OL,9,Fthrough. Feeling warm where the
OL,10,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome late brightness to end
OL,13,FMonday, then clear spells and variable
OL,14,Fcloud overnight. Staying dry
OL,15,Fthroughout. A rather warm night in
OL,16,Furban areas.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,19,Fplenty of strong sunshine across the
OL,20,Fregion. Slightly breezier than Monday
OL,21,Fbut still warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
